        'The activities that create the deepest bonds are ones that involve mild challenge, novelty, or vulnerability. "New experiences together" is a scientifically supported relationship strengthener.',
        'Rituals create safety. Safety creates openness. Openness creates intimacy. The path runs through consistency.',
