    affirmation: ['I serve from fullness and love, not from fear or obligation. My service is a gift freely given.','I notice what others need before they ask. My acts of service say: you were on my mind.','I give freely with no ledger and no score. My love is not a transaction.','I serve generously at work. My professional life is a field for love in action.','I have eyes for the neighbor in my path. I act on what I see.','I renew consistently. Replenishment is not selfishness — it is stewardship.','I receive graciously. I allow myself to be loved.'][i],
