    nutrition: { focus: 'The Before and After', meal_theme: 'Acknowledging Transformation', plan: 'Write a detailed relational "before and after" — not a highlight reel, but an honest account. Before: how did you handle conflict? How did you show love? What was your default when relationships got hard? What did you not understand about love languages? After: what is different? What has been practiced? What patterns have shifted? Honor the change, however incremental.', tip: 'Transformation that is not named is not fully owned. Claiming your growth is not arrogance — it is gratitude.', recipe_search: 'transformation growth reflection' },
